# Compile list for ASP.NET MVC 4, derived from
# Mono/external/aspnetwebstack/src/System.Web.Mvc/System.Web.Mvc.csproj.
#
# Why this lives here and not in Mono/
# ------------------------------------
# The port compiles Mono's .sources manifests, and Mono has no manifest for MVC 4 - its own copy is
# System.Web.Mvc3, a whole major version behind the aspnetwebstack submodule the port already uses
# for Razor, Web Pages and Web API. Mono/ is upstream and read-only, so the manifest is authored
# here instead, in exactly the format gen-sources.ps1 reads.
#
# Paths are relative to Mono/external/aspnetwebstack/src/System.Web.Mvc.
